+**Fail: 85 genuine tracked passages.** The stricter drafting method materially improved the
+movement, but the zero-unprotected 8-word result still does not describe its source distance.
+Chapter 24's bout and Chapter 26's rebuilt interrogatory/gate opening are independently told. The
